<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CHEMOPETROL AGM AGREES MERGER RATIO.</title>
<headline>CZECH CHEMOPETROL AGM AGREES MERGER RATIO.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech petrochemical group Chemopetrol a.s. said on Thursday that shareholders approved a merger of the company with the Czech petrochemical holding company Unipetrol a.s. at one Chemopetrol share for 1.1 Unipetrol share.</p>
<p>A company spokesman, Milan Fedic, told Reuters the annual general meeting of shareholders also approved a 13.3 crown gross dividend on 1996 profit, unchanged from 1995.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
